<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-EGYPT BEAT SENEGAL 2-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EGYPT BEAT SENEGAL 2-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt beat Senegal 2-0 (halftime 1-0) on Sunday in their group three African Nations Cup qualifier in Alexandria.</p>
<p>Scorers: Hazem Imam 12, Hady Khashaba 55 pen</p>
